## 🛠️ Development

### **Setup**
```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/mlb-parlay-agent.git
cd mlb-parlay-agent

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Set environment variables
export SUPABASE_URL="https://xxx.supabase.co"
export SUPABASE_KEY="xxx"
export ADMIN_PASSWORD="MLBparlays"
```

### **Run Locally**
```bash
# Full pipeline
python main.py

# Web server only
python src/web/server.py
```

### **Testing**
```bash
# Manual pipeline trigger (requires server running)
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/run_full_pipeline \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer MLBparlays"

# Check today's recommendations
curl http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations
```

